Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `x` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/same_call_mut_and_read_is_error.jet:8:14
    |
  8 |     both(&x, x)
    |              ^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&x`) only once, or copy first with `x.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
